# menu-x11.script — Q5 X11 leg (F5/SC9): Motif Options dialog end-to-end.
#
# Choreography: start game -> 16fps baseline window -> open the Motif dialog
# (Options button; the MouseUp handler realizes the shell and BLOCKS in the
# modal Xt pump — the D9 X11 menu seam) -> no-op dead-space click -> FPS
# scale drag 16->32 (XmNvalueChangedCallback per drag step through
# AlterFramesPerSecond = the D4 uSecondsPerFrame path) -> Exit (modal pump
# returns, ResumePlay re-arms) -> park the pointer back INSIDE the game
# window (original LeaveNotify pause semantics: with the pointer outside
# after the dialog closes, RunGame stays paused until re-enter) -> 32fps
# post window.
#
# The preferences-file Write/Read round-trip is NOT scripted on this leg:
# it requires the FileSelectionDialog sub-dialog (Filter/Selection fields),
# whose XTest-driven choreography deterministically escapes the outer modal
# (documented in qa/final-wave-evidence.md §F5). The options.H prefs format
# (29 lines, first = uSecondsPerFrame) is certified on the GL/VK legs; the
# X11 FPS preference application is asserted here by the measured period.
#
# Coordinates (game-client-relative; receipts in qa/final-wave-evidence.md):
# fixed 1280x1024 Xvfb -> game client origin = root (285,164); the Options
# dialog maps at root (0,0) 929x490 (asserted live by the driver).
#   Options button (20,15); Exit opts(7,7)..(227,51) -> (-170,-135)
#   FPS scale opts trough y169..182 x9..222, handle(v=16) x9..38,
#     value(x)=16+(x-23.5)/184*56: press (-261,12)=handle, drag (-209,12)=v32
#     [calibrated: measured 31.2-31.4 ms/frame post-exit]
#   dead space opts(450,470) -> (165,306)

1    capture title

4    keydown s
8    keyup s
39    capture start
80    capture pre_a
111    capture pre_b
115    mousedown 20 15
119    mouseup 20 15
140    capture menu_open
144    mousedown 165 306
148    mouseup 165 306
152    move 165 306
157    capture menu_noop
161    mousedown -261 12
165    move -209 12
169    mouseup -209 12
173    move 165 306
177    nop
181    nop
185    nop
189    nop
193    nop
197    nop
201    mousedown -170 -135
205    mouseup -170 -135
209    move 360 353
234    capture menu_closed
265    capture post_a
296    capture post_b
327    capture post_c
exit
